  "inbox": {
    "providerName": "Civic Gate \u00b7 issuer sandbox",
    "contract": [
      {
        "title": "Which entitlement counts?",
        "text": "The admission authorization names an entitlementId and revision. Match BOTH in entitlements. Other revisions (even newer ones) and other benefits do not authorize admission. The printed summary is retained for audit, not current availability."
      },
      {
        "title": "How many visits?",
        "text": "The referenced row holds balance and chargePerVisit in the same unit. Complete visits = floor(balance.quantity / chargePerVisit.quantity). Leftover credit cannot buy a partial visit. A balance is not a visit count."
      },
      {
        "title": "When can I validate?",
        "text": "Only state active with at least one complete visit permits validation. Paused, pending, superseded and void rows do not. A paused pass may still have complete visits on balance."
      },
      {
        "title": "What goes to the validator?",
        "text": "Submit passId, entitlementId, revision, and debit equal to that row\u2019s chargePerVisit (quantity and unit). Never send the printed summary or a count of visits as debit. An accepted receipt replaces the issuer record with the returned record; a refusal changes nothing. Cancel sends no request."
      }
    ],
